1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:03,336
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:06,464
[tense music playing]

3
00:00:20,353 --> 00:00:21,646
[screaming]

4
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,773
[shattering sound]

5
00:00:27,402 --> 00:00:30,905
-[Julio] <i>Who killed Sanggano?!</i>
-[goon] <i>It was Diego Torillo.</i>

6
00:00:30,989 --> 00:00:35,660
[Julio] <i>So, a man with a clean conscience</i>
<i>can actually kill.</i>

7
00:00:35,744 --> 00:00:37,370
[Emilia] <i>Arnaldo, my son!</i>

8
00:00:37,454 --> 00:00:39,247
[Arnaldo] <i>I have lots</i>
<i>of questions about Lily.</i>

9
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:41,332
-<i>And if you can answer--</i>
-[Julio] <i>You'll come back.</i>

10
00:00:41,416 --> 00:00:45,003
<i>I will answer all your questions,</i>

11
00:00:45,086 --> 00:00:46,921
<i>but you have to come back home.</i>

12
00:00:47,005 --> 00:00:49,382
[Mercedes] <i>Deliver the documents</i>
<i>to Red Dragon</i>

13
00:00:50,175 --> 00:00:53,762
<i>to the address written below</i>
<i>and not to the original one,</i>

14
00:00:53,845 --> 00:00:55,972
<i>so the enemy cannot track them.</i>

15
00:00:56,056 --> 00:00:57,015
<i>As you wish.</i>

16
00:00:57,098 --> 00:00:59,434
<i>Madam, here are your files.</i>

17
00:01:00,226 --> 00:01:02,479
-[Lily<i> </i>in Chinese] <i>Hello, Mercedes.</i>
<i>-You?!</i>

18
00:01:03,146 --> 00:01:05,273
[Lily] <i>Yes, Mercedes, it's me.</i>

19
00:01:05,356 --> 00:01:09,277
<i>I always make sure to know</i>
<i>my enemies well,</i>

20
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:12,280
<i>so that I can camouflage as the enemy.</i>

21
00:01:12,363 --> 00:01:16,242
[Helena] <i>Mercedes, I'll use</i>
<i>Diego Torillo against Julio.</i>

22
00:01:16,326 --> 00:01:21,581
<i>This is the perfect venue</i>
<i>to get revenge on Lily Cruz.</i>

23
00:01:21,664 --> 00:01:24,626
<i>I will join your group not as a lackey,</i>

24
00:01:24,709 --> 00:01:27,045
<i>but as Red Dragon's ally.</i>

25
00:01:27,128 --> 00:01:29,339
<i>Welcome to the organization</i>
<i>as Red Dragon's ally.</i>

26
00:01:32,717 --> 00:01:33,843
[Lily] <i>What's going on here?</i>

27
00:01:33,927 --> 00:01:36,137
<i>Surrender Diego Torillo to me.</i>

28
00:01:36,221 --> 00:01:38,598
<i>Diego Torillo is not here!</i>

29
00:01:38,681 --> 00:01:40,975
[Julio] <i>This is crazy! Search the place!</i>

30
00:01:41,059 --> 00:01:44,604
-[gunshots]
-[Lily] <i>Go ahead, Julio!</i>

31
00:01:44,687 --> 00:01:48,108
<i>I won't hesitate to blow</i>
<i>a hole in your skull!</i>

32
00:01:48,608 --> 00:01:50,610
-[Julio] No!
-[Lily] Get out!

33
00:01:50,693 --> 00:01:53,905
Leave my property!

34
00:01:53,988 --> 00:01:55,156
Okay, okay. I'm leaving.

35
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:57,784
-Now!
-[Julio] Yes! Yes, now. Okay.

36
00:01:58,368 --> 00:01:59,536
Back up, fools!

37
00:02:00,829 --> 00:02:02,705
She's crazy! She's mad!

38
00:02:04,290 --> 00:02:05,291
I'm leaving!

39
00:02:11,422 --> 00:02:13,758
Never thought this woman
could be so crazy!

40
00:02:13,842 --> 00:02:16,427
[tense music swelling]

41
00:02:21,641 --> 00:02:22,767
[Emilia] Hi, Papa!

42
00:02:22,851 --> 00:02:26,229
So, did your minions find Diego Torillo?

43
00:02:26,312 --> 00:02:28,148
They're a bunch of slowpokes.

44
00:02:28,231 --> 00:02:31,025
They're nothing compared
to the men of Sanggano.

45
00:02:31,734 --> 00:02:34,612
That's one thing
that I despise about Diego.

46
00:02:35,530 --> 00:02:37,866
He took out one of my best men.

47
00:02:39,117 --> 00:02:40,201
Hmm…

48
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:43,955
What if I tell you, Papa,
that I know where Diego is?

49
00:02:44,038 --> 00:02:45,123
[scoffs]

50
00:02:45,206 --> 00:02:47,750
And you expect me to believe you, right?

51
00:02:47,834 --> 00:02:48,960
Hmm…

52
00:02:49,502 --> 00:02:50,795
You should believe me.

53
00:02:51,254 --> 00:02:52,839
But I cannot understand it for you,

54
00:02:52,922 --> 00:02:54,966
so I won't tell you anything.

55
00:02:55,550 --> 00:02:57,010
So, get back to work, Papa.

56
00:02:58,344 --> 00:03:00,763
Oh, you can't go back to work

57
00:03:00,847 --> 00:03:03,308
because you're not yet in the position.

58
00:03:03,391 --> 00:03:05,268
So, technically, you have no work to do.

59
00:03:05,351 --> 00:03:06,978
[chuckling]

60
00:03:07,061 --> 00:03:08,187
Go ahead. Go ahead.

61
00:03:08,271 --> 00:03:10,732
Laugh your head off. Laugh all you want.

62
00:03:11,608 --> 00:03:14,611
-But I bet you all my assets.
-Wow.

63
00:03:15,653 --> 00:03:21,326
I'll be restored as the governor
of Poblacion Ardiente.

64
00:03:21,951 --> 00:03:23,995
And, when I return, do you know what my

65
00:03:24,078 --> 00:03:25,413
first legislation will be?

66
00:03:26,164 --> 00:03:28,625
I'll have you banned in this town!

67
00:03:29,334 --> 00:03:31,586
Wow, you're so harsh, Papa!

68
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:32,921
[sighs]

69
00:03:35,298 --> 00:03:37,175
Look, Papa! Look! Watch!

70
00:03:38,843 --> 00:03:40,929
<i>The campaign period had just started.</i>

71
00:03:41,721 --> 00:03:44,724
When Diego Torillo's volunteers gathered,

72
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:47,810
<i>suddenly, we were attacked</i>

73
00:03:48,728 --> 00:03:51,022
<i>Julio Ardiente's men.</i>

74
00:03:59,364 --> 00:04:01,616
I was shot by Julio Ardiente!

75
00:04:03,034 --> 00:04:06,496
That man tried to kill me!

76
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,331
[gunshots]

77
00:04:09,332 --> 00:04:11,501
-[gunshots]
-[Camia grunting]

78
00:04:12,669 --> 00:04:13,711
[gunshots]

79
00:04:15,171 --> 00:04:17,215
He cheated during the elections!

80
00:04:17,966 --> 00:04:20,176
<i>He has no right to be reinstated</i>

81
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:22,637
as the governor of this town!

82
00:04:31,312 --> 00:04:36,025
I am pleading to the witnesses
of the incident,

83
00:04:37,026 --> 00:04:38,486
<i>don't be afraid.</i>

84
00:04:39,696 --> 00:04:41,823
<i>Let us unite</i>

85
00:04:41,906 --> 00:04:46,077
<i>to prevent Julio Ardiente's</i>
<i>return to power!</i>

86
00:04:46,744 --> 00:04:48,663
[woman] <i>Is that true?</i>

87
00:04:50,331 --> 00:04:53,710
Actually, I was there when it happened.

88
00:04:53,793 --> 00:04:57,297
I witnessed how the congressman
shot Miss Camia.

89
00:04:57,380 --> 00:04:59,007
Then, why won't you testify?

90
00:04:59,090 --> 00:05:01,884
There are two possible scenarios
if I do that.

91
00:05:02,552 --> 00:05:04,137
Bite the bullet or get paid off.

92
00:05:04,220 --> 00:05:06,055
I'm lucky if they pay me.

93
00:05:06,139 --> 00:05:09,225
But if not, I'd rather shut up.

94
00:05:09,309 --> 00:05:12,979
I'm scared of the Ardientes.
My family might get hurt too.

95
00:05:13,062 --> 00:05:14,522
Of course, those witnesses are afraid.

96
00:05:14,605 --> 00:05:16,107
The Ardientes may not be
the most powerful,

97
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:17,650
but they're the richest.

98
00:05:17,734 --> 00:05:22,363
And with the return of Emilia's mom,
Helena Montoya, who's filthy rich,

99
00:05:22,905 --> 00:05:24,365
their fortune doubles!

100
00:05:24,449 --> 00:05:26,909
-That family is too much.
-They're crooked.

101
00:05:26,993 --> 00:05:27,785
Yeah, right.

102
00:05:28,286 --> 00:05:31,247
Why do they gossip about grandpa
like he's an evil person?

103
00:05:31,873 --> 00:05:34,834
[reporter] <i>Thank you, Camia Cruz.</i>

104
00:05:36,461 --> 00:05:37,628
Camia Cruz?

105
00:05:40,798 --> 00:05:42,717
Camia Cruz? The mother of Lily Cruz?

106
00:05:47,764 --> 00:05:50,349
[groaning]

107
00:05:50,433 --> 00:05:52,977
[tense music swelling]

108
00:05:54,854 --> 00:05:57,565
[breathing heavily]

109
00:06:01,277 --> 00:06:05,448
But some news says
that your claim is just a scam

110
00:06:05,531 --> 00:06:08,159
to smear the impending return

111
00:06:08,242 --> 00:06:11,370
<i>of Congressman Julio Ardiente as governor.</i>

112
00:06:13,331 --> 00:06:15,291
That's not true!

113
00:06:16,375 --> 00:06:18,044
Let's take a look at this report.

114
00:06:20,463 --> 00:06:22,757
<i>My name is Liza Paras, a teacher.</i>

115
00:06:23,299 --> 00:06:26,719
<i>I was also a volunteer for Diego Torillo</i>
<i>during the last election.</i>

116
00:06:31,140 --> 00:06:33,684
<i>I refute Camia's claims.</i>

117
00:06:35,144 --> 00:06:38,731
<i>Congressman Julio Ardiente</i>
<i>wasn't there that day.</i>

118
00:06:39,398 --> 00:06:42,944
<i>So, it's impossible for him</i>
<i>to have shot Camia.</i>

119
00:06:50,576 --> 00:06:54,497
[Camia] <i>Teacher Liza, that's not true!</i>

120
00:06:54,580 --> 00:06:58,209
<i>You are lying! You were there!</i>

121
00:06:58,292 --> 00:06:59,794
<i>You liar!</i>

122
00:07:02,713 --> 00:07:08,594
[reporter] <i>Will this development help</i>
<i>in the pending appeal of Julio Ardiente</i>

123
00:07:08,678 --> 00:07:12,223
<i>to be reinstated as the governor</i>
<i>of Poblacion Ardiente?</i>

124
00:07:12,306 --> 00:07:13,766
<i>Stay tuned.</i>

125
00:07:20,106 --> 00:07:22,108
Poblacion Ardiente.

126
00:07:23,151 --> 00:07:26,988
Your handsome governor is back!

127
00:07:27,071 --> 00:07:30,491
[laughing and clapping]

128
00:07:30,950 --> 00:07:32,160
How do you like that?

129
00:07:32,243 --> 00:07:34,579
Now, what can you say about it,
little brat?

130
00:07:35,621 --> 00:07:37,457
I'm not gonna comment now, Papa.

131
00:07:37,540 --> 00:07:39,417
I'll cross that bridge when I get there.

132
00:07:41,794 --> 00:07:43,713
I hope the bridge burns.

133
00:07:44,464 --> 00:07:45,465
[door closes]

134
00:07:47,133 --> 00:07:48,968
Congratulations, Mercedes.

135
00:07:49,051 --> 00:07:51,721
You closed the deal with Diego Torillo.

136
00:07:52,847 --> 00:07:55,141
So, I guess, I've redeemed myself
in your eyes, Madam.

137
00:07:55,224 --> 00:07:57,268
[scoffs] Not so fast.

138
00:07:57,894 --> 00:08:01,564
Lily Cruz is still out there
with evidence against us.

139
00:08:02,565 --> 00:08:05,610
What about the vault? Is it secure enough?

140
00:08:06,235 --> 00:08:07,278
But of cour--

141
00:08:10,907 --> 00:08:13,743
[tense music playing]

142
00:08:18,748 --> 00:08:19,832
[grunts loudly]

143
00:08:23,711 --> 00:08:24,670
Mercedes?!

144
00:08:25,171 --> 00:08:27,798
[exhales] Yes, Madam.

145
00:08:28,883 --> 00:08:29,884
Good.

146
00:08:37,308 --> 00:08:38,601
[line ringing]

147
00:08:38,684 --> 00:08:40,144
Hello, Mr. Larson.

148
00:08:40,728 --> 00:08:43,147
I'm calling about Red Dragon's vault.

149
00:08:43,231 --> 00:08:44,857
[suspenseful music]

150
00:08:46,817 --> 00:08:47,818
[elevator bell dings]

151
00:09:31,571 --> 00:09:33,656
Helena Montoya's account, please.

152
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,283
Key, please.

153
00:09:46,043 --> 00:09:47,712
Show her through. Thank you.

154
00:10:02,852 --> 00:10:03,978
[line ringing]

155
00:10:04,061 --> 00:10:05,771
Security, she's here.

156
00:10:32,757 --> 00:10:34,675
[suspenseful music continues]

157
00:10:50,983 --> 00:10:56,155
[alarm blaring]

158
00:11:06,707 --> 00:11:07,708
[door opens]

159
00:11:09,418 --> 00:11:10,836
Your key doesn't work!

160
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:12,463
Maybe that's what triggered the alarm!

161
00:11:13,047 --> 00:11:14,882
What kind of service is this?!

162
00:11:15,466 --> 00:11:16,759
I'm very sorry, Madam.

163
00:11:16,842 --> 00:11:20,012
This is your faulty key!
I don't need it anymore!

164
00:11:20,388 --> 00:11:24,183
[action music playing]

165
00:11:32,733 --> 00:11:33,734
[elevator bell dings]

166
00:11:45,579 --> 00:11:46,664
[dings]

167
00:11:49,291 --> 00:11:50,418
Thank you.

168
00:11:52,044 --> 00:11:53,963
-Mom.
-Lily.

169
00:11:55,798 --> 00:11:57,883
I heard about what happened
during the interview.

170
00:11:58,175 --> 00:12:01,137
Don't worry, that has no basis in court.

171
00:12:02,638 --> 00:12:03,597
[exhales]

172
00:12:03,681 --> 00:12:04,723
I hope so.

173
00:12:06,225 --> 00:12:07,935
Do you have the documents?

174
00:12:09,228 --> 00:12:12,815
I have bank statements, files,
and other transactions,

175
00:12:13,274 --> 00:12:17,778
but what I need is the list
of Red Dragon's clients.

176
00:12:17,862 --> 00:12:19,572
That's what I need the most.

177
00:12:23,993 --> 00:12:25,911
[Mercedes] What do you mean,
it won't open?!

178
00:12:26,495 --> 00:12:27,997
It might be the wrong key.

179
00:12:34,462 --> 00:12:36,213
This is the correct key.

180
00:12:38,048 --> 00:12:40,634
Unless Lily Cruz might have replaced it.

181
00:12:47,933 --> 00:12:49,059
[alarm blares]

182
00:12:49,143 --> 00:12:50,936
Where is your CCTV?!

183
00:12:51,020 --> 00:12:53,105
I need to know what's been going on here.

184
00:12:53,189 --> 00:12:55,316
Give me an update the minute
you open this vault.

185
00:12:55,399 --> 00:12:56,275
Do you understand?!

186
00:12:57,526 --> 00:12:59,528
And Red Dragon must never
find out about this!

187
00:12:59,612 --> 00:13:01,071
Am I making myself clear?!

188
00:13:12,917 --> 00:13:16,378
[Vanessa] So, Diego Torillo…

189
00:13:17,421 --> 00:13:18,881
You're officially part of our group.

190
00:13:21,008 --> 00:13:23,219
Maybe you should get to know us better.

191
00:13:24,970 --> 00:13:26,013
[Romulo clears throat]

192
00:13:38,317 --> 00:13:40,069
Mercedes told me to keep an eye on you,

193
00:13:40,152 --> 00:13:41,487
so behave yourself!

194
00:13:41,570 --> 00:13:43,948
You can't do
extracurricular activities here.

195
00:13:44,490 --> 00:13:46,242
I'm here for my mission.

196
00:13:47,368 --> 00:13:48,410
What mission?

197
00:13:50,996 --> 00:13:53,040
To bring down the Ardientes.

198
00:13:54,792 --> 00:13:57,086
If you say so,
I'll take your word on that.

199
00:13:58,170 --> 00:14:01,423
I hope Red Dragon was right
to recruit you.

200
00:14:01,507 --> 00:14:03,509
-[phone ringing]
-Stay right there.

201
00:14:04,134 --> 00:14:06,929
-We'll have your training later.
-[phone ringing]

202
00:14:07,471 --> 00:14:08,597
Yes, Mr. Black?

203
00:14:10,766 --> 00:14:11,934
The shipment is ready.

204
00:14:12,226 --> 00:14:13,894
[tense music playing]

205
00:14:17,356 --> 00:14:18,649
When should we make the barter?

206
00:14:20,609 --> 00:14:21,610
Okay, sure.

207
00:14:36,792 --> 00:14:37,960
What are you looking at?

208
00:14:39,253 --> 00:14:40,087
Do you have a problem?

209
00:14:41,005 --> 00:14:42,548
Are you curious about what I'm doing?

210
00:14:43,340 --> 00:14:44,800
Maybe you're a spy!

211
00:14:45,926 --> 00:14:49,305
I'm observing how I'm going
to replace you.

212
00:14:49,722 --> 00:14:51,140
-What a piece of--
-Go ahead.

213
00:14:51,974 --> 00:14:53,559
I'm not a lackey like you.

214
00:14:54,685 --> 00:14:56,312
I'm an ally of Red Dragon.

215
00:14:57,688 --> 00:15:00,566
Let us see how she'll react
if you dare touch me.

216
00:15:18,167 --> 00:15:21,712
[man] Boss! Idol! You're the man!

217
00:15:22,922 --> 00:15:26,175
Is it true? You're going to live here?

218
00:15:26,258 --> 00:15:29,345
I thought your brother's wife
had you on a leash.

219
00:15:30,179 --> 00:15:31,972
Now what? Let's go back to business!

220
00:15:33,432 --> 00:15:34,975
Both of you, shut up.

221
00:15:35,935 --> 00:15:39,313
I'm not in the mood to fool around.

222
00:15:41,398 --> 00:15:42,942
[tense music]

223
00:15:44,401 --> 00:15:46,278
Boss, we've got company!

224
00:15:51,575 --> 00:15:54,036
[Fabian] Well, look at this,
the fake Jaguar.

225
00:16:00,084 --> 00:16:01,210
[Raul] I'm unarmed.

226
00:16:08,842 --> 00:16:09,969
Can we talk?

227
00:16:11,929 --> 00:16:13,013
Lower your guns!

228
00:16:16,558 --> 00:16:18,936
Are you two deaf? Put down your guns!

229
00:16:21,855 --> 00:16:22,898
Leave us!

230
00:16:31,365 --> 00:16:32,700
Why did you come here?

231
00:16:35,953 --> 00:16:37,287
I just want to thank you…

232
00:16:38,914 --> 00:16:40,791
for what you did for me and Diego Torillo.

233
00:16:41,458 --> 00:16:42,501
You helped us.

234
00:16:46,296 --> 00:16:47,423
Why did you do that?

235
00:16:48,298 --> 00:16:49,967
It's over now. You may leave.

236
00:16:56,557 --> 00:16:58,350
Diego Torillo is here

237
00:16:59,184 --> 00:17:00,728
in Red Dragon's lair.

238
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:08,110
I came to ask for a favor.

239
00:17:09,778 --> 00:17:11,655
Please look after the kid.

240
00:17:13,073 --> 00:17:15,075
What is Diego Torillo to you?

241
00:17:15,159 --> 00:17:18,162
We don't have the time for that story.

242
00:17:22,082 --> 00:17:23,876
Just look after the kid

243
00:17:25,127 --> 00:17:26,670
because he's important to me.

244
00:17:29,965 --> 00:17:31,842
Diego Torillo is a good kid.

245
00:17:32,968 --> 00:17:33,969
You can count on me.

246
00:17:37,765 --> 00:17:38,891
Thank you.

247
00:17:40,392 --> 00:17:43,937
Thanks. And even though I know
that this is not my mask,

248
00:17:44,563 --> 00:17:46,231
and I stole it from you,

249
00:17:48,233 --> 00:17:49,735
you still helped us.

250
00:17:50,861 --> 00:17:54,656
Now, to make it up to you
and end this conversation…

251
00:17:57,326 --> 00:17:58,410
[Damian] Stop.

252
00:18:01,038 --> 00:18:05,125
Let's use these masks
to protect the people we love…

253
00:18:08,003 --> 00:18:11,507
and in our fight against the Ardientes.

254
00:18:31,151 --> 00:18:32,194
Jaguar.

255
00:18:33,946 --> 00:18:34,947
Thank you.

256
00:18:41,954 --> 00:18:44,998
[action music playing]

257
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:14,111
[action music continues]

258
00:19:14,403 --> 00:19:16,905
They were right. You really are fast.

259
00:19:17,322 --> 00:19:19,783
-Because I'm not all talk.
-Is that so?

260
00:19:30,878 --> 00:19:31,920
[grunts]

261
00:19:36,216 --> 00:19:37,050
[grunts]

262
00:19:38,427 --> 00:19:40,679
[thumping]

263
00:19:51,148 --> 00:19:52,065
[grunts]

264
00:20:07,372 --> 00:20:09,708
[Vanessa] Boss? Boss?

265
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:12,961
Boss?

266
00:20:17,007 --> 00:20:20,010
[Romulo coughing]

267
00:20:22,512 --> 00:20:23,639
Where's Diego?

268
00:20:23,722 --> 00:20:24,765
Diego!

269
00:20:30,312 --> 00:20:31,271
Put that down!

270
00:20:34,358 --> 00:20:36,902
[Diego] My apologies.
I thought it was mine.

271
00:20:37,444 --> 00:20:38,528
-[grunts]
-[coughs]

272
00:20:41,031 --> 00:20:43,033
The next time you touch my things,

273
00:20:43,533 --> 00:20:45,118
you'll get even worse.

274
00:20:45,202 --> 00:20:48,956
I don't care if you're the apple
of Red Dragon's eye

275
00:20:49,456 --> 00:20:50,874
because I'll beat you up so bad!

276
00:20:52,084 --> 00:20:53,752
No one will recognize your pretty face!

277
00:20:56,338 --> 00:20:57,506
Speak up!

278
00:20:58,215 --> 00:20:59,508
You think highly of yourself!

279
00:20:59,841 --> 00:21:01,802
[Diego groaning]

280
00:21:01,885 --> 00:21:03,053
[Jaguar] Romulo!

281
00:21:04,471 --> 00:21:05,555
Jaguar!

282
00:21:05,639 --> 00:21:06,890
[Jaguar] We're all on the same side.

283
00:21:06,974 --> 00:21:08,558
We shouldn't be killing each other!

284
00:21:09,351 --> 00:21:10,978
Since when did you become a babysitter?!

285
00:21:11,853 --> 00:21:13,855
Let go of Diego!

286
00:21:15,983 --> 00:21:17,567
[Diego gags and coughs]

287
00:21:17,651 --> 00:21:19,861
-You better teach this kid!
-[Diego coughing]

288
00:21:19,945 --> 00:21:21,405
He's touching my stuff!

289
00:21:25,909 --> 00:21:28,620
[Diego breathing heavily]

290
00:21:30,205 --> 00:21:33,875
[Jaguar] Inform me the next time
Romulo bothers you.

291
00:21:38,338 --> 00:21:39,881
You are the other Jaguar.

292
00:21:41,842 --> 00:21:42,884
Who are you?

293
00:21:43,635 --> 00:21:44,845
I am the original.

294
00:21:46,430 --> 00:21:47,973
I don't need your help.

295
00:21:49,975 --> 00:21:51,226
[Jaguar] That's what you think.

296
00:21:51,935 --> 00:21:54,730
You turned your back
on a lot of people to get here.

297
00:21:55,564 --> 00:21:58,817
You're all alone. You need some support.

298
00:22:01,695 --> 00:22:02,946
I can take care of myself.

299
00:22:22,591 --> 00:22:24,968
[tense music]

300
00:22:28,013 --> 00:22:29,097
[gunshot]

301
00:22:39,816 --> 00:22:42,277
-[gunshot]
-[gasps]

302
00:22:42,778 --> 00:22:45,739
[panting]

303
00:22:48,450 --> 00:22:52,287
[tense music continues]

304
00:23:38,708 --> 00:23:40,252
[Jepoy] Arnaldo, let's eat.

305
00:23:41,461 --> 00:23:43,088
Anna made you some food.

306
00:23:44,089 --> 00:23:45,674
You haven't eaten all day.

307
00:23:48,218 --> 00:23:49,344
Let's eat together.

308
00:23:52,973 --> 00:23:54,474
Arnaldo! Stop!

309
00:23:54,558 --> 00:23:56,643
-What are you doing?!
-Let go of me!

310
00:23:56,726 --> 00:23:58,103
No, no, no! Have you gone mad?!

311
00:23:58,186 --> 00:24:00,272
Let me die! Please!

312
00:24:00,730 --> 00:24:02,858
Hold on! This is not the way!

313
00:24:02,941 --> 00:24:04,025
-What's the matter?!
-I don't know!

314
00:24:04,109 --> 00:24:07,154
Then, what's the right way?!
Nothing makes sense!

315
00:24:07,237 --> 00:24:08,446
I can't take it anymore!

316
00:24:08,655 --> 00:24:10,490
What's the matter with you?!

317
00:24:11,616 --> 00:24:13,910
-I don't know! I give up!
-If I didn't show up in time…

318
00:24:13,994 --> 00:24:15,370
-I give up!
-…you'd be dead by now.

319
00:24:15,453 --> 00:24:17,080
I give up! I don't know!

320
00:24:17,164 --> 00:24:19,541
-What's wrong, Arnaldo?!
-I don't know!

321
00:24:19,624 --> 00:24:21,251
I don't know, Jepoy!

322
00:24:21,501 --> 00:24:22,460
Come on. What's the matter?

323
00:24:22,544 --> 00:24:25,338
Lily… Lily.

324
00:24:25,422 --> 00:24:26,506
Take me to Lily.

325
00:24:28,175 --> 00:24:31,052
She can answer my questions.
I need to talk to her.

326
00:24:31,136 --> 00:24:32,220
Bring me to Lily.

327
00:24:33,180 --> 00:24:35,932
Jepoy, bring me to Lily. [whimpering]

328
00:24:37,184 --> 00:24:39,102
Come on! Bring me to Lily!

329
00:24:39,644 --> 00:24:40,854
Take me to Lily!

330
00:24:40,937 --> 00:24:43,523
Please! I'm begging you!

331
00:24:44,691 --> 00:24:46,568
She's the only one who can help me.

332
00:24:47,861 --> 00:24:51,364
It's killing me. I don't know what to do.

333
00:24:59,956 --> 00:25:01,291
-[Arnaldo] Lily!
-[Jepoy] Arnaldo.

334
00:25:01,958 --> 00:25:03,335
-Lily!
-[Jepoy] Calm down, Arnaldo!

335
00:25:03,418 --> 00:25:05,503
-She won't talk to you.
-[Arnaldo] Lily!

336
00:25:06,129 --> 00:25:07,255
Lily, come out!

337
00:25:07,339 --> 00:25:08,882
Get your act together. Cool down.

338
00:25:10,050 --> 00:25:11,968
[Arnaldo] Jepoy, I just want
to talk to her.

339
00:25:13,136 --> 00:25:15,388
[tense music]

340
00:25:31,279 --> 00:25:32,113
Ivy.

341
00:25:40,038 --> 00:25:41,831
-[chuckles] Ivy.
-It's Lily.

342
00:25:43,208 --> 00:25:44,459
Lily Cruz.

343
00:25:44,542 --> 00:25:46,503
-That's my name.
-No, it's Ivy Aguas.

344
00:25:46,586 --> 00:25:49,047
-It's Lily Cruz!
-Your name is Ivy Aguas!

345
00:25:51,466 --> 00:25:54,511
I know because I've seen lots
of videos and photos of you.

346
00:25:54,594 --> 00:25:58,056
There's even a news article
about a wedding.

347
00:25:59,099 --> 00:26:00,141
Our wedding.

348
00:26:01,851 --> 00:26:03,561
Our wedding that didn't push through.

349
00:26:06,314 --> 00:26:07,899
Now, I want to know what happened.

350
00:26:09,401 --> 00:26:11,403
Tell me what happened! What is the truth?!

351
00:26:11,486 --> 00:26:12,737
What is the real truth?!

352
00:26:13,947 --> 00:26:14,990
Tell me!

353
00:26:15,073 --> 00:26:19,077
I'm not sure if the truth
would sit well with you.

354
00:26:19,953 --> 00:26:21,454
But I think, Arnaldo,

355
00:26:22,289 --> 00:26:24,082
it would be best if you don't know

356
00:26:24,165 --> 00:26:27,502
-the whole story.
-No, I need to know, Lily!

357
00:26:28,211 --> 00:26:30,297
-[Jepoy] Stop it, Arnaldo!
-[Arnaldo] Let me through!

358
00:26:30,380 --> 00:26:32,716
Let me through! Ivy! Ivy! Ivy!

359
00:26:32,799 --> 00:26:34,676
-[Jepoy] Wait, stop it.
-Ivy.

360
00:26:34,759 --> 00:26:36,720
I just want to talk to her, Jepoy!

361
00:26:39,973 --> 00:26:40,974
Ivy.

362
00:26:43,435 --> 00:26:45,145
I don't know if I should
call you Ivy or Lily,

363
00:26:45,228 --> 00:26:48,064
but I know for sure that I like you.

364
00:26:50,442 --> 00:26:52,861
I've liked you
since the first time I saw you.

365
00:26:56,990 --> 00:26:58,992
And then I discovered
our supposed marriage.

366
00:27:02,078 --> 00:27:05,749
Can you blame me for asking questions?

367
00:27:08,084 --> 00:27:09,419
Could you blame me?

368
00:27:09,502 --> 00:27:12,380
Tell me the reason why you leave me.

369
00:27:12,464 --> 00:27:14,174
[somber music playing]

370
00:27:19,012 --> 00:27:20,847
Please answer me. I'm begging you.

371
00:27:25,226 --> 00:27:27,854
You killed my Nanny Carlotta.

372
00:27:27,937 --> 00:27:30,106
[tense music playing]

373
00:27:32,484 --> 00:27:34,986
You're a murderer, Arnaldo!

374
00:27:36,529 --> 00:27:38,073
You wanted the truth?!

375
00:27:39,157 --> 00:27:40,867
That's the whole truth!

376
00:27:41,451 --> 00:27:44,454
Now, you may leave my house!

377
00:27:44,829 --> 00:27:47,624
[tense music intensifies]

378
00:28:04,099 --> 00:28:05,141
[thumping]

379
00:28:13,691 --> 00:28:15,402
[Lily] <i>I know you want to be alone.</i>

380
00:28:16,027 --> 00:28:18,029
<i>I'm sorry, I can't give you that.</i>

381
00:28:18,571 --> 00:28:20,949
<i>I don't want to leave you.</i>
<i>That's why I'm here.</i>

382
00:28:21,658 --> 00:28:22,909
<i>Forgive me.</i>

383
00:28:31,126 --> 00:28:36,089
["Nanghihinayang"
by Angeline Quinto playing]

384
00:28:44,848 --> 00:28:47,434
[Lily] <i>I won't let you turn</i>
<i>into a criminal!</i>

385
00:28:47,517 --> 00:28:50,687
<i>There's no place for justice</i>
<i>here in Ardiente!</i>

386
00:28:50,770 --> 00:28:52,647
<i>-I will kill them.</i>
-[Lily] <i>Diego!</i>

387
00:28:52,731 --> 00:28:53,815
[Jepoy] <i>Diego!</i>

388
00:28:53,898 --> 00:28:55,233
<i>Sanggano was found dead.</i>

389
00:28:55,316 --> 00:28:58,653
<i>Information says that Diego</i>
<i>was the one who killed him.</i>

390
00:28:58,737 --> 00:29:00,238
<i>I spoke with Diego earlier.</i>

391
00:29:00,613 --> 00:29:02,449
<i>He said he wasn't ready to come back.</i>

392
00:29:06,202 --> 00:29:10,248
["Nanghihinayang" continues playing]

393
00:29:13,376 --> 00:29:16,045
[Diego] <i>I'll make sure</i>
<i>that your plans will succeed.</i>

394
00:29:16,379 --> 00:29:17,964
<i>Even if it costs my life,</i>

395
00:29:18,298 --> 00:29:20,675
<i>I won't let anything bad happen to you.</i>

396
00:29:21,134 --> 00:29:22,093
[Lily] <i>Diego,</i>

397
00:29:22,177 --> 00:29:26,139
<i>thank you for keeping your promise…</i>

398
00:29:27,390 --> 00:29:29,893
<i>that you'd help me succeed.</i>

399
00:29:31,019 --> 00:29:33,062
<i>I hope you'll be with me</i>
<i>until the very end.</i>

400
00:29:41,112 --> 00:29:47,368
["Nanghihinayang" continues playing]

401
00:30:07,972 --> 00:30:10,600
[song fading]

402
00:30:12,352 --> 00:30:13,686
[Arnaldo screaming]
I can't take it anymore!

403
00:30:13,770 --> 00:30:14,646
I can't take it anymore!

404
00:30:14,729 --> 00:30:16,898
[mumbling] Give me back my memories!

405
00:30:18,817 --> 00:30:21,945
Are you punishing me?! Are you?! Huh?!

406
00:30:25,907 --> 00:30:27,826
Give me back my memories.

407
00:30:28,451 --> 00:30:30,578
Give them back.

408
00:30:32,997 --> 00:30:37,627
[sobbing]

409
00:30:42,882 --> 00:30:43,925
[Magbanua] Diego!

410
00:30:44,342 --> 00:30:45,468
Diego Torillo.

411
00:30:46,135 --> 00:30:48,555
I can't believe you are here all along.

412
00:30:50,890 --> 00:30:52,934
Oh, that's right, you don't know me.

413
00:30:56,354 --> 00:30:59,357
If you didn't kill Sanggano,
I wouldn't be here.

414
00:30:59,941 --> 00:31:00,942
Thank you.

415
00:31:03,486 --> 00:31:05,363
-Bring him in.
-[goon] Let's go!

416
00:31:07,073 --> 00:31:10,326
[men grunting]

417
00:31:18,084 --> 00:31:19,210
[goon] Hey! Stand up!

418
00:31:20,128 --> 00:31:21,713
Come on! Stand up!

419
00:31:23,006 --> 00:31:24,048
Stay still!

420
00:31:26,801 --> 00:31:29,470
[grunting]

421
00:31:34,058 --> 00:31:34,934
[grunts]

422
00:31:42,108 --> 00:31:43,610
[grunting]

423
00:31:47,989 --> 00:31:49,073
[grunts]

424
00:32:13,806 --> 00:32:14,849
[thumps]

425
00:32:14,933 --> 00:32:15,975
[chuckles]

426
00:32:21,856 --> 00:32:22,899
[grunts]

427
00:32:22,982 --> 00:32:25,443
[gagging]

428
00:32:28,404 --> 00:32:29,405
[Magbanua coughs]

429
00:32:31,074 --> 00:32:32,075
[exhales]

430
00:32:43,670 --> 00:32:44,754
This one is yours.

431
00:33:10,446 --> 00:33:11,364
[Helena] Mercedes.

432
00:33:12,281 --> 00:33:13,324
Yes, Madam?

433
00:33:14,867 --> 00:33:16,744
Bring me Diego Torillo.

434
00:33:23,084 --> 00:33:24,460
[Helena] No, wait.

435
00:33:26,379 --> 00:33:29,590
-Julio Ardiente attacked, right?
-Yes.

436
00:33:30,049 --> 00:33:31,592
But nothing we can't handle.

437
00:33:32,969 --> 00:33:34,303
The war has begun.

438
00:33:36,014 --> 00:33:37,682
Tell Diego Torillo to wait.

439
00:33:39,308 --> 00:33:42,645
I'm going somewhere. Get the car ready.

440
00:33:53,406 --> 00:33:54,449
What happened?

441
00:33:56,367 --> 00:34:02,790
You allowed a bunch of females
to beat your men to a pulp?!

442
00:34:05,960 --> 00:34:08,379
Get out of here! Get lost! Get out!

443
00:34:10,631 --> 00:34:11,674
Damn!

444
00:34:14,802 --> 00:34:15,803
[door closes]

445
00:34:16,262 --> 00:34:17,346
[sighs]

446
00:34:21,809 --> 00:34:26,981
I know why you recruited
Diego Torillo, Helena.

447
00:34:28,649 --> 00:34:33,029
You know that I will get mad and furious!

448
00:34:35,615 --> 00:34:36,657
No matter.

449
00:34:38,367 --> 00:34:41,746
Even if you and all my enemies
band together,

450
00:34:42,413 --> 00:34:45,249
you are not going to shake me down.

451
00:34:46,751 --> 00:34:50,254
Not the great Julio Ardiente!

452
00:34:51,964 --> 00:34:53,091
Watch out.

453
00:34:54,175 --> 00:34:55,927
[sighs deeply]

454
00:34:56,719 --> 00:34:59,639
[suspenseful music playing]

455
00:35:21,244 --> 00:35:22,286
You all right?

456
00:35:26,165 --> 00:35:28,751
Julio Ardiente is still after you.

457
00:35:29,502 --> 00:35:33,172
The violence won't stop,
no matter whose camp you join.

458
00:35:34,590 --> 00:35:36,092
It could be worse for you

459
00:35:36,175 --> 00:35:38,678
now that you sided with Red Dragon.

460
00:35:40,638 --> 00:35:42,932
Or maybe you have other motives?

461
00:36:02,827 --> 00:36:05,037
Well, hello, "frenemy."

462
00:36:05,413 --> 00:36:06,414
[scoffs]

463
00:36:06,956 --> 00:36:10,585
-You're back.
-Yes, I feel safer now.

464
00:36:11,252 --> 00:36:15,047
I made sure that my enemies
have something to worry about.

465
00:36:15,715 --> 00:36:17,592
But you know what?
There's just one glitch.

466
00:36:18,301 --> 00:36:22,805
Your underlings won't leave
my new apprentice.

467
00:36:24,557 --> 00:36:26,934
Diego Torillo.

468
00:36:28,436 --> 00:36:29,979
This is all your doing.

469
00:36:31,397 --> 00:36:33,274
It's like you're taunting me.

470
00:36:33,357 --> 00:36:36,194
You know that I am hunting that kid…

471
00:36:36,736 --> 00:36:39,113
for killing my best henchman.

472
00:36:40,364 --> 00:36:42,158
And just to annoy me…

473
00:36:43,492 --> 00:36:46,704
you took him in like a son.

474
00:36:47,914 --> 00:36:51,125
Well, not everything is about you, is it?

475
00:36:51,209 --> 00:36:52,627
[chuckling]

476
00:36:53,586 --> 00:36:57,757
There you are greatly mistaken.

477
00:36:58,424 --> 00:37:03,888
Because everything is about me
in this town.

478
00:37:04,972 --> 00:37:07,391
And the next time you spite me,

479
00:37:08,517 --> 00:37:12,021
I'll turn your minions' heads
into bowling balls.

480
00:37:12,104 --> 00:37:15,316
Julio, please stop making declarations

481
00:37:15,399 --> 00:37:18,152
that you can't back up with power.

482
00:37:18,236 --> 00:37:22,531
Real power, that apparently
you don't have right now.

483
00:37:22,615 --> 00:37:24,242
[laughing]

484
00:37:24,951 --> 00:37:32,458
Well, enjoy your supposed
temporary power while it lasts.

485
00:37:33,376 --> 00:37:36,128
Because I won't allow you

486
00:37:36,212 --> 00:37:39,757
to play the queen in my own territory.

487
00:37:39,840 --> 00:37:44,929
And I'm going to make sure
that you kneel and beg

488
00:37:45,012 --> 00:37:49,433
by the time I return as governor!

489
00:37:50,601 --> 00:37:51,686
I'm telling you,

490
00:37:52,520 --> 00:37:55,398
no woman has picked a fight
with me and won.

491
00:37:57,191 --> 00:37:58,651
You're just a woman, Helena.

492
00:37:59,777 --> 00:38:03,072
And as desirable as you are,

493
00:38:03,781 --> 00:38:05,366
you won't win against me.

494
00:38:06,492 --> 00:38:09,996
You're just a woman like Lily Cruz,

495
00:38:10,079 --> 00:38:16,460
and like your daughter Emilia,
who's crazy like you.

496
00:38:17,586 --> 00:38:20,423
Well, we'll see about that.

497
00:38:22,550 --> 00:38:23,467
I'll get you yet.

498
00:38:37,773 --> 00:38:38,774
[Helena scoffs]

499
00:38:39,358 --> 00:38:43,112
It's finally nice to meet you
face to face.

500
00:38:44,113 --> 00:38:45,156
Sit.

501
00:38:59,920 --> 00:39:01,714
You know why you're here.

502
00:39:05,217 --> 00:39:07,011
And you know why I'm here.

503
00:39:08,804 --> 00:39:10,681
That worked quite well for you, didn't it?

504
00:39:12,433 --> 00:39:15,061
You're alive because of my dragon ladies.

505
00:39:16,896 --> 00:39:19,607
And I already spoke with Julio.

506
00:39:20,191 --> 00:39:24,320
I told him to stop hunting you.

507
00:39:25,780 --> 00:39:29,116
But that man is so delusional.

508
00:39:43,547 --> 00:39:45,216
[upbeat music playing]

509
00:39:46,217 --> 00:39:47,593
What's that for?

510
00:39:49,637 --> 00:39:51,472
You want me to kill Julio?

511
00:39:52,098 --> 00:39:53,307
[chuckles] You know what?

512
00:39:53,849 --> 00:39:55,518
That was my first choice.

513
00:39:56,227 --> 00:39:57,728
But then I thought…

514
00:39:59,814 --> 00:40:02,942
<i>you</i> need a test run.

515
00:40:05,569 --> 00:40:06,904
I heard…

516
00:40:08,072 --> 00:40:12,243
you and Lily are a thing.

517
00:40:13,577 --> 00:40:15,955
-We're over now.
-Really?

518
00:40:16,831 --> 00:40:17,957
Cheers!

519
00:40:21,419 --> 00:40:22,420
[clink]

520
00:40:23,963 --> 00:40:25,714
[Lily] I learned my lesson, Attorney.

521
00:40:27,091 --> 00:40:32,930
I need to file a lawsuit
that will bring Red Dragon down.

522
00:40:33,514 --> 00:40:35,808
That's why I targeted her bank accounts…

523
00:40:36,392 --> 00:40:39,895
to cripple her once the truth comes out.

524
00:40:40,604 --> 00:40:42,356
But I need her list of clients

525
00:40:42,440 --> 00:40:45,860
to further cripple her organization.

526
00:40:46,986 --> 00:40:48,028
[Camia] But, Lily…

527
00:40:49,238 --> 00:40:50,906
how are you going to get that list?

528
00:40:51,866 --> 00:40:55,244
Remember, Mercedes
and Red Dragon had marked you

529
00:40:55,327 --> 00:40:56,954
for infiltrating the organization.

530
00:40:57,496 --> 00:40:59,498
That's right, Aunt Camia.
We are all marked.

531
00:41:00,124 --> 00:41:01,750
That's why we can't move freely.

532
00:41:04,587 --> 00:41:08,257
Maybe that is the reason
why Red Dragon took Diego in.

533
00:41:09,675 --> 00:41:10,634
[Camia] What?!

534
00:41:11,302 --> 00:41:13,888
Diego is now working for Red Dragon?

535
00:41:15,097 --> 00:41:16,140
Yes.

536
00:41:16,474 --> 00:41:20,644
Intel says that Julio Ardiente
attacked Diego,

537
00:41:20,728 --> 00:41:23,189
but Red Dragon's minions
came to rescue him.

538
00:41:24,273 --> 00:41:25,983
I can see two possible scenarios here.

539
00:41:27,401 --> 00:41:28,444
First…

540
00:41:29,987 --> 00:41:32,948
Red Dragon will use Diego
against you, Lily.

541
00:41:34,700 --> 00:41:39,455
And second, she could use Diego
against Julio Ardiente.

542
00:41:39,538 --> 00:41:40,623
Please sit down.

543
00:41:45,211 --> 00:41:47,004
We've got different ideologies.

544
00:41:47,880 --> 00:41:49,924
Well, you know what? You're right.

545
00:41:51,675 --> 00:41:53,177
Immediately break free

546
00:41:53,260 --> 00:41:57,389
when you feel that you are
being used and abused.

547
00:41:58,641 --> 00:42:01,143
Don't be like me and Julio
who had a child.

548
00:42:01,227 --> 00:42:03,521
[laughing]

549
00:42:11,946 --> 00:42:15,950
For your first job as my ally…

550
00:42:17,576 --> 00:42:22,373
I want you to kill Lily Cruz.

551
00:42:22,456 --> 00:42:24,583
[tense music playing]

552
00:42:26,835 --> 00:42:28,337
[Camia] Diego? Lily!

553
00:42:30,130 --> 00:42:31,882
Have you heard anything from him?

554
00:42:39,807 --> 00:42:43,060
In order to win against Red Dragon,

555
00:42:43,143 --> 00:42:45,229
we need to maintain our focus.

556
00:42:50,150 --> 00:42:52,403
We can't waste our time
on things like that.

557
00:42:54,572 --> 00:42:57,324
I need to get that list.

558
00:42:58,993 --> 00:43:00,494
And I have a plan.

559
00:43:13,591 --> 00:43:17,386
My gift for you. I made it myself.

560
00:43:17,970 --> 00:43:20,347
It's made of African diamonds.

561
00:43:21,307 --> 00:43:25,352
Come on, try it. It's so beautiful on you.

562
00:43:25,436 --> 00:43:29,231
I call it "Princess Emilia."

563
00:43:33,902 --> 00:43:34,945
All right.

564
00:43:35,404 --> 00:43:38,699
I'm sorry for not involving you
in the group's operations.

565
00:43:39,033 --> 00:43:43,662
But I just wanted to protect
you, my baby girl, my princess.

566
00:43:45,623 --> 00:43:50,085
Mama, I used to be a politician,
a governor.

567
00:43:51,211 --> 00:43:52,880
I don't need this tiara.

568
00:43:54,214 --> 00:43:57,092
What I want is to be part
of your organization.

569
00:44:04,850 --> 00:44:05,851
All right.

570
00:44:06,560 --> 00:44:08,687
I will make you my right-hand man,

571
00:44:08,771 --> 00:44:10,105
along with Mercedes.

572
00:44:10,731 --> 00:44:11,732
But, Mama…

573
00:44:12,816 --> 00:44:14,109
For your first project,

574
00:44:14,193 --> 00:44:16,362
I want you to take care
of the big, big comeback

575
00:44:16,445 --> 00:44:17,780
of Helena Montoya,

576
00:44:18,364 --> 00:44:21,367
for the anniversary of my organization.

577
00:44:22,242 --> 00:44:24,620
Can you take care of that
for me, baby girl?

578
00:44:26,497 --> 00:44:28,457
-Okay, Mama, I'll do it.
-[Helena giggles]

579
00:44:34,505 --> 00:44:35,756
Come on, put it on.

580
00:44:35,839 --> 00:44:37,925
It looks perfect on you.

581
00:44:38,926 --> 00:44:42,096
-My princess.
-[chuckles]

582
00:44:44,181 --> 00:44:49,520
[foreboding music playing]

583
00:45:15,379 --> 00:45:21,552
[tense music playing]

584
00:45:42,739 --> 00:45:43,866
Diego.

585
00:45:43,949 --> 00:45:48,787
[romantic music playing]

586
00:46:02,217 --> 00:46:04,303
<i>I thought you'd never see me again.</i>

587
00:46:06,847 --> 00:46:09,933
<i>I'm sorry for all I've said</i>
<i>and done to you.</i>

588
00:46:11,935 --> 00:46:14,104
<i>I know you are just concerned about me.</i>

589
00:46:17,065 --> 00:46:18,358
<i>I don't want to lose you.</i>

590
00:46:19,860 --> 00:46:21,403
<i>I'll never leave.</i>

591
00:46:23,447 --> 00:46:24,948
<i>I'll never leave you, Diego.</i>

592
00:46:27,451 --> 00:46:29,870
<i>Like I said, everything you did,</i>

593
00:46:29,953 --> 00:46:32,372
<i>I understand it all.</i>

594
00:46:33,749 --> 00:46:35,334
<i>I feel your sentiments.</i>

595
00:46:37,669 --> 00:46:38,712
<i>Diego…</i>

596
00:46:42,841 --> 00:46:44,885
<i>I can never be mad at you.</i>

597
00:46:46,553 --> 00:46:47,554
<i>Never.</i>

598
00:46:48,847 --> 00:46:51,183
<i>I waited every single day…</i>

599
00:46:52,851 --> 00:46:54,144
<i>because I knew…</i>

600
00:46:55,145 --> 00:46:56,730
<i>I knew that you'd come back.</i>

601
00:46:59,566 --> 00:47:02,778
-<i>Forgive me, Lily.</i>
-[sniffles]

602
00:47:02,861 --> 00:47:04,655
<i>Please forgive me. Please forgive me.</i>

603
00:47:19,628 --> 00:47:21,129
<i>There's something you should know.</i>

604
00:47:22,506 --> 00:47:24,424
<i>I've infiltrated the lair of Red Dragon.</i>

605
00:47:25,342 --> 00:47:26,343
<i>I've gained access to everything.</i>

606
00:47:26,426 --> 00:47:28,428
<i>Just tell me what you need.</i>

607
00:47:34,101 --> 00:47:38,063
<i>Diego, I need a list</i>
<i>of Red Dragon's clients.</i>

608
00:47:38,772 --> 00:47:40,023
<i>Once I get that,</i>

609
00:47:40,107 --> 00:47:43,485
<i>I can stop her entire operations.</i>

610
00:47:48,073 --> 00:47:49,116
<i>The blue book.</i>

611
00:47:58,125 --> 00:47:59,960
-Diego.
-Here's the blue book.

612
00:48:01,169 --> 00:48:03,213
It contains the list
of Red Dragon's clients.

613
00:48:04,590 --> 00:48:05,632
What's your plan?

614
00:48:09,052 --> 00:48:12,598
I'll have her lair raided.
Do not return there.

615
00:48:13,515 --> 00:48:14,558
Lily.

616
00:48:15,267 --> 00:48:17,060
[suspenseful music]

617
00:48:21,898 --> 00:48:22,858
Listen to me, Diego.

618
00:48:22,941 --> 00:48:26,236
If you return there without my head,
they'll kill you instead.

619
00:48:27,404 --> 00:48:28,488
Diego, please.

620
00:48:29,197 --> 00:48:32,451
Don't worry, Lily. I'll be fine.

621
00:48:32,534 --> 00:48:36,622
What's important is we take down
Red Dragon and the Ardientes!

622
00:48:36,705 --> 00:48:41,126
-I promise you, I'll be fine.
-Diego, please.

623
00:48:42,294 --> 00:48:43,378
-Diego.
-I have to go.

624
00:48:43,920 --> 00:48:44,963
Diego!

625
00:48:46,923 --> 00:48:47,966
Diego.

626
00:49:01,938 --> 00:49:03,148
[sighs]

627
00:49:03,231 --> 00:49:05,692
[dramatic music playing]

628
00:49:14,242 --> 00:49:15,619
<i>The case against me is dismissed.</i>

629
00:49:15,702 --> 00:49:18,789
<i>I will be going back to the capitol</i>

630
00:49:18,872 --> 00:49:23,877
<i>to claim my rightful title</i>
<i>as governor of Ardiente!</i>

631
00:49:23,960 --> 00:49:26,213
<i>Suspiciously, why is Lily Cruz not here?</i>

632
00:49:26,296 --> 00:49:29,132
<i>As a matter of fact,</i>
<i>she's leaving the country,</i>

633
00:49:29,216 --> 00:49:31,134
<i>and my people are already after her.</i>

634
00:49:31,218 --> 00:49:34,346
[Emilia] <i>Piece of advice.</i>
<i>Lily Cruz never flees.</i>

635
00:49:34,429 --> 00:49:37,349
<i>And more importantly, she never dies.</i>

636
00:49:37,432 --> 00:49:39,101
[Helena] <i>Lily, what are you doing here?</i>

637
00:49:39,184 --> 00:49:41,395
<i>I am the one who will expose</i>

638
00:49:41,478 --> 00:49:46,191
<i>the real identity of Helena Montoya.</i>

639
00:49:47,192 --> 00:49:49,319
[theme music playing]
